Python scaffold — Tea with Nessie
1.	From the assignment folder, install deps and generate starter files if needed.
2.	Open mail_merge.py and read the TODOs.
3.	Run: python scaffold_python/mail_merge.py
4.	Check output/ for one invitation per guest.
5.	Customise the Word template fields, re-run, and document your logic in the 3-page plan (use plan_outline.docx).
Commands
•	pip install -r requirements.txt
•	python generate_data.py
•	python scaffold_python/mail_merge.py
